    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1705562369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/3db7548ca41e309ebaa0dd38695701f6.poster.avif?t=1705562369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/3db7548ca41e309ebaa0dd38695701f6.webm?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/3db7548ca41e309ebaa0dd38695701f6.mp4?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>My Soul Forever is a 2D puzzle game about a knight who could control his ghost spirit. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/67a1279cb7e2bec422cdc2d94ce1aee7.poster.avif?t=1705562369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/67a1279cb7e2bec422cdc2d94ce1aee7.webm?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/67a1279cb7e2bec422cdc2d94ce1aee7.mp4?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Some time later, the knight descended into the dungeon, swarming with many goblins and other monsters. To get out, he will have to show all his mind and dexterity, and skill. Find keys, keys to rooms, avoid obstacles, and spirit catchers, they are extremely dangerous, the spirit dies - there will be no knight.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/4e9a1106c7d336e8005e33911a5cc25b.poster.avif?t=1705562369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/4e9a1106c7d336e8005e33911a5cc25b.webm?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/4e9a1106c7d336e8005e33911a5cc25b.mp4?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Game functions: dual character control, an unforgettable adventure about a knight, graphics by wineloco, music by Popro.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/a83bf31adb7e42aae05030dcd6a1e8c9.poster.avif?t=1705562369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/a83bf31adb7e42aae05030dcd6a1e8c9.webm?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207050/extras/a83bf31adb7e42aae05030dcd6a1e8c9.mp4?t=1705562369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
